Welcome to MipLinux!

Tips:
  Wired network: just plug in (DHCP)
  Wi-Fi: nmcli or nmtui
    nmcli device wifi rescan
    nmcli device wifi list
    nmcli device wifi connect "SSID" password "PWD"

If the installer UI disappears: press Ctrl+Alt+F1 to return to it (it runs on tty1).
If tty1 shows a shell instead, run: systemctl start mipl-installer

Docs: https://github.com/MipLinux/MipLinux
